  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help for the wounded in Ukraine during the war</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Innocent Ukrainians are dying and suffering every day from Russia&apos;s barbaric actions - they are ruthlessly shelling our homes, kindergartens, hospitals and even maternity wards. Russian forces have no pity for children, pregnant women or the elderly. But despite the fear of death, Ukrainians continue to help each other. Doctors and medical staff are forced to live in their workplace. In addition to the wounded, there are also non-transportable patients in medical institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
